        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mormon 6:4",
        "book": "Mormon",
        "chapter": 6,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "And when three hundred and eighty and four years had passed away, we had gathered in all the remainder of our people unto the land of Cumorah.",
