      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that they did fall upon my people with the sword, and with the bow, and with the arrow, and with the ax, and with all manner of weapons of war.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mormon 6:9",
        "book": "Mormon",
        "chapter": 6,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that my men were hewn down, yea, even my ten thousand who were with me, and I fell wounded in the midst; and they passed by me that they did not put an end to my life.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 61,
