      {
        "text": "And when they had gone through and hewn down all my people save it were twenty and four of us, (among whom was my son Moroni) and we having survived the dead of our people, did behold on the morrow, when the Lamanites had returned unto their camps, from the top of the hill Cumorah, the ten thousand of my people who were hewn down, being led in the front by me.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 45,
            "end": 48,
            "text": "1 Ne. 12:19 (19–20); Hel. 15:17 (16–17); Morm. 3:2."
